{"unit_id":"tag:06FG:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们首先要证明，与“平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（finitely presented）的群胚（groupoid）”相伴的商叠（quotient stack）<MATH_0001>是代数叠（algebraic stack）。商叠（quotient stack）的定义见《空间（Spaces）中的群胚（Groupoids）》的定义<REF_0001>。下面的引理是一个预备结果，它是《代数叠（Algebraic Stacks）》的引理<REF_0002>的对应版本。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"修饰群胚；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限呈示","context":"此处为局部有限呈示条件；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"groupoid","target_term":"群胚","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠","context":"未批准，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Spaces","target_term":"空间","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数叠","context":"所引章节标题；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
